        <div class="prose">
          <p>Hung Gar is one of the oldest and most recognized Southern Shaolin styles, known for its low, powerful stances and the Tiger-Crane form. Our sifu carries this lineage directly and teaches it in its traditional form — not a modernized derivative.</p>
          <p>Classes combine forms (<em>tao lu</em>), conditioning, bridge-hand drills, and — for students who want it — sparring and lion dance fundamentals.</p>
